Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:51.20,H_fil,,0,0,0,,Itinapon siya sa dagat ng pating sa mismong wedding day...
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:51.20,C_fil,,0,0,0,,Panuorin LAHAT — LIBRE ▶ YT688.app
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:02.36,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Kakatapos ko lang maging tunay na tagapagmana ng Shen Group.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.40,0:00:09.57,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Pero dalawang oras lang ang nakalipas,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.61,0:00:12.93,S_fil,,0,0,0,,ang pekeng anak na inalagaan nila sa loob ng 20 taon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.97,0:00:15.85,S_fil,,0,0,0,,ay sadya akong itinapon sa
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.89,0:00:24.60,S_fil,,0,0,0,,dagat na puno ng pating.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.64,0:00:27.08,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Bakit?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.12,0:00:30.29,S_fil,,0,0,0,,BAKIT?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.33,0:00:34.67,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Ang regalong ito? Para sa'yo talaga 'to.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.71,0:00:36.63,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Bago ka pa makabalik,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.67,0:00:38.80,S_fil,,0,0,0,,ako ang tanging anak na babae ng pamilyang Shen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.84,0:00:40.00,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Mahal ako ni Mama at Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.04,0:00:41.64,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Pinoprotektahan ako ng mga kuya ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.68,0:00:43.53,S_fil,,0,0,0,,At pati si Kuya Mo...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.57,0:00:51.18,S_fil,,0,0,0,,dapat sa akin na.
